PPE / HW-NAT offload port from the Linux 6.12 XR500v tree.

Squashed forward-port of the econet-eth PPE chain (upstream patches
350-395 of the 6.12 tree, minus the gsw DSA-VLAN ones and minus the
TX/BQL fixes already carried here by 140-tx-bql-ownership).

Adds econet_ppe.{c,h}: FoE table core, engine arm/disarm, the RX bind
hook, nf_flowtable offload (flow_block_cb/flow_cls_offload), the DSA
egress-port encoding and the WHNAT WiFi hooks.

